{
  "_about": "Off-ramp pricing. protocolFee = floor(asset * protocolFeeBps / 10000) (AttestedEscrow.protocolFeeOn, ProtocolFee::split); convertible = asset - protocolFee; gross = floor(convertible * R * 10^2 / 10^(assetDecimals + s)) where the rate is R with s decimal places; fee = feeFixed + ceil(gross * feeBps / 10000); net = gross - fee; minFiat <= gross <= maxFiat; fee < gross. NGN minor exponent 2. Computed independently in Python integer arithmetic, not by either implementation. Read by the aggregator (recoil-core/aggregator/crates/types/tests/fiat_pricing_vector.rs: FiatQuote::price_offramp, ProtocolFee::split) and by the Merchant Agent (repo recoil-labs/merchant-agent, crates/agent-core/src/policy/pricing.rs), so both price a trade identically. Test values only.",
